{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟日前披露下一代Windows AI PC發展路線圖，試圖為未來數年的人工智能個人電腦市場建立統一分級體系。根據規劃，微軟將依據設備內存容量、AI處理能力以及本地運行大模型的能力，將未來AI PC劃分為四個不同層級，覆蓋從入門級辦公設備到具備工作站級算力的高端系統。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584846.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.481744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:57:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"43781e0318cd50b36869c7d98a69bd221f8fe64569e5da80b988862a715ac2d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}